  FT["PH-H7341"] = {"id":"PH-H7341","coverage":"full","language":"en","sourceName":"LawPhil 菲律宾法律虚拟图书馆（The LawPhil Project – Arellano Law Foundation）","sourceUrl":"https://lawphil.net/statutes/repacts/ra2000/ra_8873_2000.html","fetchedAt":"2026-10-06","articleCount":5,"structureMode":"ARTICLE","title":{"zh":"将高山省Bontoc市镇Balili描笼涯的Mountain Province普通综合中学附属校分离为独立的Albago国立中学，并为此拨付所需经费","en":"An Act Separating the Mountain Province General Comprehensive High School Annex in Barangay Balili, Municipality of Bontoc, Mountain Province From the Mountain Province General Comprehensive High School in the Municipality of Bontoc, Mountain Province and Converting the Same Into An Independent National High School to Be Known as the Albago National High School and Appropriating Funds Therefor","orig":"An Act Separating the Mountain Province General Comprehensive High School Annex in Barangay Balili, Municipality of Bontoc, Mountain Province From the Mountain Province General Comprehensive High School in the Municipality of Bontoc, Mountain Province and Converting the Same Into An Independent National High School to Be Known as the Albago National High School and Appropriating Funds Therefor","vi":"Đạo luật tách Phân hiệu của Trường Trung học Toàn diện Mountain Province General tại Barangay Balili, Đô thị Bontoc, Tỉnh Mountain Province khỏi Trường Trung học Toàn diện Mountain Province General và chuyển thành Trường Trung học Độc lập Quốc gia với tên gọi Trường Trung học Albago Quốc gia, và bố trí kinh phí","th":"พระราชบัญญัติแยกวิทยาเขตของโรงเรียนมัธยมศึกษาแบบครบวงจร Mountain Province General ในบารังไกย์ Balili เทศบาล Bontoc จังหวัด Mountain Province ออกจากโรงเรียนมัธยมศึกษาแบบครบวงจร Mountain Province General และยกฐานะเป็นโรงเรียนมัธยมศึกษาเอกเทศแห่งชาติชื่อโรงเรียนมัธยมศึกษา Albago แห่งชาติ และจัดสรรงบประมาณ","id":"Undang-Undang Memisahkan Kampus, Sekolah Menengah Terpadu Mountain Province General di Barangay Balili, Kotamadya Bontoc, Provinsi Mountain Province dari Sekolah Menengah Terpadu Mountain Province General dan menjadi Sekolah Menengah Mandiri Nasional dengan nama Sekolah Menengah Albago Nasional, dan mengalokasikan dana","ms":"Akta Memisahkan Kampus, Sekolah Menengah Menyeluruh Mountain Province General di Barangay Balili, Perbandaran Bontoc, Wilayah Mountain Province daripada Sekolah Menengah Menyeluruh Mountain Province General dan menjadi Sekolah Menengah Bebas Kebangsaan dengan nama Sekolah Menengah Albago Kebangsaan, dan memperuntukkan dana"},"level":"law","status":"active","topics":["administrative","education"],"docNumber":"Republic Act No. 8873","issuingBody":"Congress of the Philippines","promulgatedDate":"2000-08-22","completenessNote":"全文，共 5 条；逐字取自 LawPhil 菲律宾法律虚拟图书馆（The LawPhil Project – Arellano Law Foundation） 官方页面（statutes/repacts/ra2000/ra_8873_2000.html），未改写、未摘译、未节选；原文语言：英语。 条文抬头依源文为 “Section N.” 等形式，本库统一规范为 “Section N.”；首行抬头与条内标题的分段依源文块级边界还原。","country":"PH","countryName":"菲律宾","layer":"intl","articles":[{"id":"PH-H7341-A1","no":1,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 1."},"text":{"en":"The Mountain Province General Comprehensive High School Annex in Barangay Balili, Municipality of Bontoc, Mountain Province is hereby separated from the Mountain Province General Comprehensive High School in the Municipality of Bontoc, Mountain Province and converted into an independent national high school to be known as the Albago National High School."}},{"id":"PH-H7341-A2","no":2,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 2."},"text":{"en":"The Secretary of the Department of Education, Culture and Sports shall issue such orders, rules and circulars as may be necessary for the implementation of this Act."}},{"id":"PH-H7341-A3","no":3,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 3."},"text":{"en":"All personnel, records, assets and liabilities of the Mountain Province General Comprehensive High School-Balili Annex are hereby transferred to and absorbed by the Albago National High School."}},{"id":"PH-H7341-A4","no":4,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 4."},"text":{"en":"The amount necessary for the initial implementation of this Act shall be charged against the current year's appropriations of the Mountain Province General Comprehensive High School-Balili Annex. Thereafter, such sums as may be necessary for the continuous operation and maintenance of the Albago National High School shall be included in the annual General Appropriations Act."}},{"id":"PH-H7341-A5","no":5,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 5."},"text":{"en":"This Act shall take effect upon its approval."}}],"pack":"ph-p104","titleTranslation":{"engine":"llm","model":"deepseek-v4.1-flash","reviewed":false,"batch":"CALR-TITLE-20261017-1837-PH-7575","source":"An Act Separating the Mountain Province General Comprehensive High School Annex in Barangay Balili, Municipality of Bontoc, Mountain Province From the Mountain Province General Comprehensive High School in the Municipality of Bontoc, Mountain Province and Converting the Same Into An Independent National High School to Be Known as the Albago National High School and Appropriating Funds Therefor","note":"由翻译 agent 按《法规标题中译规范》产出，经 tools/verify-title-return.js 机器校验后入库；尚未人工复核。"}};
