  FT["PH-H7352"] = {"id":"PH-H7352","coverage":"full","language":"en","sourceName":"LawPhil 菲律宾法律虚拟图书馆（The LawPhil Project – Arellano Law Foundation）","sourceUrl":"https://lawphil.net/statutes/repacts/ra2000/ra_8884_2000.html","fetchedAt":"2026-10-06","articleCount":3,"structureMode":"ARTICLE","title":{"zh":"设立Dingle市","en":"An Act Establishing a National High School in Barangay Tabugon, Municipality of Dingle, Province of Iloilo to Be Known as Tabugon National High School and Appropriating Funds Therefor","orig":"An Act Establishing a National High School in Barangay Tabugon, Municipality of Dingle, Province of Iloilo to Be Known as Tabugon National High School and Appropriating Funds Therefor","vi":"Đạo luật thành lập Trường trung học phổ thông quốc gia tại Barangay Tabugon, Thị trấn Dingle, Tỉnh Iloilo được biết đến với tên gọi Trường trung học phổ thông quốc gia Tabugon","th":"พระราชบัญญัติจัดตั้งโรงเรียนมัธยมศึกษาตอนปลายแห่งชาติในบารังไกย์ Tabugon, เทศบาล Dingle, จังหวัด Iloilo ให้เป็นที่รู้จักในชื่อโรงเรียนมัธยมศึกษาตอนปลายแห่งชาติ Tabugon","id":"Undang-Undang mendirikan Sekolah Menengah Atas Nasional di Barangay Tabugon, Kotamadya Dingle, Provinsi Iloilo dikenal sebagai Sekolah Menengah Atas Nasional Tabugon","ms":"Akta menubuhkan Sekolah Menengah Kebangsaan di Barangay Tabugon, Perbandaran Dingle, Wilayah Iloilo dikenali sebagai Sekolah Menengah Kebangsaan Tabugon"},"level":"law","status":"active","topics":["administrative","education"],"docNumber":"Republic Act No. 8884","issuingBody":"Congress of the Philippines","promulgatedDate":"2000-08-22","completenessNote":"全文，共 3 条；逐字取自 LawPhil 菲律宾法律虚拟图书馆（The LawPhil Project – Arellano Law Foundation） 官方页面（statutes/repacts/ra2000/ra_8884_2000.html），未改写、未摘译、未节选；原文语言：英语。 条文抬头依源文为 “Section N.” 等形式，本库统一规范为 “Section N.”；首行抬头与条内标题的分段依源文块级边界还原。","country":"PH","countryName":"菲律宾","layer":"intl","articles":[{"id":"PH-H7352-A1","no":1,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 1."},"text":{"en":"There shall be established, under the supervision of the Department of Education, Culture and Sports, a national high school in Barangay Tabugon, Municipality of Dingle, Province of Iloilo, to be known as the Tabugon National High School."}},{"id":"PH-H7352-A2","no":2,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 2."},"text":{"en":"The Secretary of the Department of Education, Culture and Sports shall issue the necessary rules and regulations for the effective implementation of this Act."}},{"id":"PH-H7352-A3","no":3,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 3."},"text":{"en":"The amount necessary to carry out the provisions of this Act shall be included in the General Appropriations Act of the year following its enactment into law and thereafter."}}],"pack":"ph-p104"};
